      productsAndApplications:
        'Group pages by scope: drug substance, drug product, biologics, or contract manufacturing for a sponsor. This specialization sits under <a href="/industrial/chemical-process-manufacturing">chemical and process manufacturing</a> as the sector home. Food and beverage production belongs on <a href="/industrial/food-beverage-manufacturing">food and beverage manufacturing</a> and should not be described as a drug plant.\n\nDo not name a therapeutic claim, a clinical result, or a patient population as if the website were a label. The page is about manufacturing scope.',
